3"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.498,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'Dismiss all 5 alerts via the code-scanning API with `dismissed_reason=\"false positive\"` and a per-alert evidence comment'","GitHub REST `PATCH /repos/{owner}/{repo}/code-scanning/alerts/{alert_number}` requires `state` (dismissed|open); `dismissed_reason` is only honored with `state=dismissed`","Testing section names the reversal as `-f state=open` but never the forward `state=dismissed`"],"finding":"The dismissal step names `dismissed_reason=\"false positive\"` but never specifies the full write invocation: the PATCH method, the per-alert path `.../code-scanning/alerts/{alert_number}`, and the co-required `state=dismissed` field. The GitHub code-scanning API rejects a `dismissed_reason` unless `state=dismissed` is sent in the same request, so as written the step is under-specified and could fail at runtime.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2d18a784f4645437","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan step 1 / AC1","norm_id":"n038e157049111291","priority":0.402,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["Operator runs `gh api ... -f dismissed_reason='false positive'` without `-f state=dismissed` and the PATCH is rejected / no-ops"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"For each alert N in {83,84,85,86,87}: `gh api --method PATCH repos/navapbc/rebar/code-scanning/alerts/N -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason='false positive' -f dismissed_comment='<per-alert evidence>'`.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"insufficient","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_vali